1
00:00:05,305 --> 00:00:07,805
(Raj:)So I read a study that
says a man with a dog

2
00:00:07,975 --> 00:00:10,285
(Raj:)is three times more likely
to get a woman's phone number.

3
00:00:10,444 --> 00:00:12,424
(Leonard:)Is it true even when
the man lets his dog

4
00:00:12,579 --> 00:00:14,919
(Leonard:)lick peanut butter off his tongue?

5
00:00:15,082 --> 00:00:17,292
(Raj:)I don't see why not.

6
00:00:18,652 --> 00:00:20,132
(Howard:)If you're really desperate
to meet women

7
00:00:20,287 --> 00:00:22,357
(Howard:)and like having food
eaten out of your mouth,

8
00:00:22,522 --> 00:00:24,502
(Howard:)I could set you up with my mom.

9
00:00:25,859 --> 00:00:27,669
(Sheldon:)Why is that funny?

10
00:00:28,996 --> 00:00:30,806
(Sheldon:)That's just unhygienic.

11
00:00:32,032 --> 00:00:34,702
(Leonard:)-It's a joke.
-I don't think so.

12
00:00:35,802 --> 00:00:38,612
(Sheldon:)I believe that a joke
is a brief oral narrative

13
00:00:38,772 --> 00:00:41,052
(Sheldon:)with a climactic humorous twist.

14
00:00:41,208 --> 00:00:44,158
(Sheldon:)For example,
Wolowitz's mother is so fat

15
00:00:44,311 --> 00:00:46,381
(Sheldon:)that she decided
to go on a diet,

16
00:00:46,546 --> 00:00:49,356
(Sheldon:)or exercise, or both.

17
00:00:51,718 --> 00:00:56,968
(Sheldon:)See? The twist is that people
don't usually change.

18
00:00:59,793 --> 00:01:02,023
(Sheldon:)Well, they don't.

